sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Agent AI · 源码中的一次成功问答 / A successful request in source
    accDescr: On main, Express completes the PDF answer before starting the web answer. The captured demo used a different build and returned HTTP 502.
    participant U as React
    participant A as Express
    participant L as OpenAI
    participant M as MCP server
    participant W as SerpAPI
    U->>A: POST /upload · PDF
    U->>A: GET /chat · 问题 / Question
    Note over A,L: 先处理 PDF / Document path first
    A->>A: 提取并切分 / Extract + split
    A->>L: 文本与问题嵌入 / Embed text + query
    L-->>A: 向量 / Vectors
    A->>A: 内存检索 / Retrieve passages
    A->>L: 问题 + 片段 / Question + passages
    L-->>A: 文档回答 / Document answer
    Note over A,W: 再搜索网页 / Then search the web
    A->>M: search_web · stdio
    M->>W: 同一问题 / Same question
    W-->>M: 搜索结果 / Search results
    M-->>A: 工具结果 / Tool result
    A->>L: 归纳网页资料 / Summarize web results
    L-->>A: 网页回答 / Web answer
    A-->>U: ragAnswer + mcpAnswer
